WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:31.250
In verses 16.13 to 16.15,

2
00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:35.208
Lord Krishna revealed the thinking
of demoniac persons.

3
00:00:35.208 --> 00:00:38.500
Now He turns our attention to
their inner condition

4
00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:40.791
and its consequences.

5
00:00:40.791 --> 00:00:42.166
He explains –

6
00:00:42.166 --> 00:00:46.291
attachment to sensory pleasure
does not give contentment.

7
00:00:46.291 --> 00:00:49.000
It scatters the mind.

8
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:52.750
A life entangled in the web of
delusion loses its direction

9
00:00:52.750 --> 00:00:58.291
and ultimately falls into foul
and hellish circumstances.

10
00:01:03.208 --> 00:01:05.416
Here Lord Krishna describes the state

11
00:01:05.416 --> 00:01:08.541
of the demoniac mind in detail.

12
00:01:08.541 --> 00:01:12.000
Aneka-chitta-vibhrantah, that is,

13
00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:15.583
a mind wandering in many directions.

14
00:01:15.583 --> 00:01:18.166
It does not remain steady in any one direction.

15
00:01:18.166 --> 00:01:21.416
It keeps being pulled toward wealth,

16
00:01:21.416 --> 00:01:25.000
toward power, toward pleasure and prestige.

17
00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:29.083
This restless mind stays entangled
in pointless scheming.

18
00:01:29.083 --> 00:01:30.583
‘One more goal,

19
00:01:30.583 --> 00:01:34.333
one more rival, one more thing.’

20
00:01:34.333 --> 00:01:38.083
Then He says, moha-jala-samavritah,

21
00:01:38.083 --> 00:01:41.333
that is, covered in the net of delusion.

22
00:01:41.333 --> 00:01:43.083
Just as a fish caught in a net

23
00:01:43.083 --> 00:01:47.666
becomes more entangled the
more it struggles to escape,

24
00:01:47.666 --> 00:01:50.375
in the same way the person, layer by layer,

25
00:01:50.375 --> 00:01:53.416
becomes bound in self-deception.

26
00:01:53.416 --> 00:01:56.458
The delusion is not only of wealth or position.

27
00:01:56.458 --> 00:02:01.666
The real delusion is this – ‘these things
will give me ultimate joy.’

28
00:02:01.666 --> 00:02:03.875
Then Lord Krishna says,

29
00:02:03.875 --> 00:02:07.708
prasaktah kama-bhogeshhu, that is,

30
00:02:07.708 --> 00:02:12.458
deeply attached to desires and
sensual cravings.

31
00:02:12.458 --> 00:02:14.875
This is not ordinary interest.

32
00:02:14.875 --> 00:02:17.875
It is the frenzy of attachment.

33
00:02:17.875 --> 00:02:19.916
The senses become deities,

34
00:02:19.916 --> 00:02:22.833
and indulgence becomes dharma.

35
00:02:22.833 --> 00:02:24.666
The more they chase,

36
00:02:24.666 --> 00:02:27.083
the more pleasure slips away,

37
00:02:27.083 --> 00:02:30.708
and desire returns even stronger.

38
00:02:30.708 --> 00:02:34.000
The vision never rises toward
a higher purpose.

39
00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:37.000
The next indulgence becomes the only goal.

40
00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:38.875
Lord Krishna explains that the fall –

41
00:02:38.875 --> 00:02:41.041
patanti narakeshuchau –

42
00:02:41.041 --> 00:02:42.750
means as a result,

43
00:02:42.750 --> 00:02:46.875
the person falls into a foul, hellish condition.

44
00:02:46.875 --> 00:02:49.000
They do not only fall morally

45
00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:51.541
or spiritually,

46
00:02:51.541 --> 00:02:53.625
but suffer deeply.

47
00:02:53.625 --> 00:02:57.916
In this life and beyond.

48
00:02:57.916 --> 00:02:59.583
This is not about the afterlife.

49
00:02:59.583 --> 00:03:02.000
It happens right here.

50
00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:04.000
When people appear successful

51
00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:06.250
but within are living

52
00:03:06.250 --> 00:03:08.291
a hellish life.

53
00:03:08.291 --> 00:03:14.000
Stressed, alone, anxious, and empty.

54
00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:16.666
This verse is to warn us.

55
00:03:16.666 --> 00:03:20.416
Uncontrolled desire and delusion
do not liberate.

56
00:03:20.416 --> 00:03:22.000
They bind.

57
00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:25.250
A mind divided in many directions

58
00:03:25.250 --> 00:03:28.375
can never reach peace.

59
00:03:28.375 --> 00:03:29.291
True joy

60
00:03:29.291 --> 00:03:30.916
is born only

61
00:03:30.916 --> 00:03:33.458
when the heart is connected not
to perishable pleasures,

62
00:03:33.458 --> 00:03:37.333
but to an eternal foundation.

63
00:03:42.083 --> 00:03:45.333
When the mind scatters,

64
00:03:45.333 --> 00:03:49.583
chasing one thing after another,

65
00:03:49.583 --> 00:03:52.833
then what truly matters

66
00:03:52.833 --> 00:03:55.625
begins to disappear from sight.

67
00:03:55.625 --> 00:03:59.833
Those who are prasaktah kama-bhogeshhu,

68
00:03:59.833 --> 00:04:00.916
that is, those

69
00:04:00.916 --> 00:04:05.000
deeply attached to sensual pleasures,

70
00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:10.833
sink deeper and deeper into the web of delusion.

71
00:04:10.833 --> 00:04:16.625
They believe that the next pleasure
will give peace.

72
00:04:16.625 --> 00:04:18.916
But it never does.

73
00:04:18.916 --> 00:04:22.125
You chase a desire,

74
00:04:22.125 --> 00:04:23.708
it is fulfilled.

75
00:04:23.708 --> 00:04:27.083
A moment of excitement comes,

76
00:04:27.083 --> 00:04:31.416
and then the same emptiness returns.

77
00:04:31.416 --> 00:04:34.250
Instead of discernment, you again

78
00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:37.291
run toward the very indulgence

79
00:04:37.291 --> 00:04:42.000
that created this emptiness in the first place.

80
00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:45.708
This very cycle pulls you deeper.

81
00:04:45.708 --> 00:04:50.291
Until even the difference between
real and hollow

82
00:04:50.291 --> 00:04:54.291
becomes blurred.

83
00:04:54.291 --> 00:04:57.666
But the truth is –

84
00:04:57.666 --> 00:05:02.625
you do not want indulgence, you want peace.

85
00:05:02.625 --> 00:05:04.125
And peace

86
00:05:04.125 --> 00:05:08.333
does not come from fulfilling every desire.

87
00:05:08.333 --> 00:05:10.250
It comes

88
00:05:10.250 --> 00:05:14.000
when the mind connects to a higher foundation.

89
00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:16.125
That is,

90
00:05:16.125 --> 00:05:19.000
to Me.

91
00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:22.541
When your thoughts slow down.

92
00:05:22.541 --> 00:05:25.500
When the heart becomes steady,

93
00:05:25.500 --> 00:05:29.083
vision becomes clear again.

94
00:05:29.083 --> 00:05:32.958
Beginning this journey is not difficult.

95
00:05:32.958 --> 00:05:35.541
Pause for a moment.

96
00:05:35.541 --> 00:05:40.000
Recognise the tendencies within you.

97
00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:43.416
Then redirect your energy from attachment

98
00:05:43.416 --> 00:05:47.000
toward clarity.

99
00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:48.625
This is the path –

100
00:05:48.625 --> 00:05:52.000
out of delusion,

101
00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:54.333
and into being rooted

102
00:05:54.333 --> 00:05:55.416
in yourself.

103
00:05:59.875 --> 00:06:02.000
When a family's centre

104
00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:05.000
becomes only indulgence,

105
00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:12.000
more comforts, more resources,
more experiences,

106
00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:14.875
then something sacred

107
00:06:14.875 --> 00:06:18.666
slowly begins to disappear.

108
00:06:18.666 --> 00:06:22.791
Prasaktah kama-bhogeshhu.

109
00:06:22.791 --> 00:06:29.333
When attachment to pleasures
becomes a frenzy,

110
00:06:29.333 --> 00:06:30.625
it

111
00:06:30.625 --> 00:06:33.916
covers the mind.

112
00:06:33.916 --> 00:06:37.458
And when the mind scatters,

113
00:06:37.458 --> 00:06:41.916
aneka-chitta-vibhrantah,

114
00:06:41.916 --> 00:06:44.000
relationships too

115
00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:47.750
begin to weaken.

116
00:06:47.750 --> 00:06:49.083
Slowly,

117
00:06:49.083 --> 00:06:53.458
even under the same roof,

118
00:06:53.458 --> 00:06:56.416
people stop being companions.

119
00:06:56.416 --> 00:06:58.833
They become consumers.

120
00:06:58.833 --> 00:07:02.458
Everyone runs after their own pleasure,

121
00:07:02.458 --> 00:07:07.083
but no one has enough time

122
00:07:07.083 --> 00:07:13.833
to truly be present for each other.

123
00:07:13.833 --> 00:07:16.958
Guidance is lost,

124
00:07:16.958 --> 00:07:22.500
emotional support diminishes,

125
00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:27.416
and when someone breaks within,

126
00:07:27.416 --> 00:07:32.291
often no one even notices,

127
00:07:32.291 --> 00:07:36.875
or knows what to say.

128
00:07:36.875 --> 00:07:40.958
In such a home, decisions are made
not from maturity,

129
00:07:40.958 --> 00:07:47.791
but from loneliness and fear.

130
00:07:47.791 --> 00:07:52.333
And such decisions, without discernment, often

131
00:07:52.333 --> 00:07:54.708
lead toward sorrow.

132
00:07:54.708 --> 00:07:58.625
Sometimes even toward self-destruction.

133
00:07:58.625 --> 00:08:02.333
Remember, your family members

134
00:08:02.333 --> 00:08:07.000
are not here for your indulgence.

135
00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:09.416
They are souls,

136
00:08:09.416 --> 00:08:13.041
entrusted to you.

137
00:08:13.041 --> 00:08:16.208
For support, growth,

138
00:08:16.208 --> 00:08:20.708
and to lift each other higher.

139
00:08:20.708 --> 00:08:24.791
If this is forgotten,

140
00:08:24.791 --> 00:08:28.208
the very bonds that can break

141
00:08:28.208 --> 00:08:31.375
are your life's foundation.

142
00:08:31.375 --> 00:08:35.708
Build a home where love

143
00:08:35.708 --> 00:08:38.833
runs deeper than luxury,

144
00:08:38.833 --> 00:08:41.916
and care is more visible

145
00:08:41.916 --> 00:08:43.583
than convenience.

146
00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:50.250
You may be working hard,

147
00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:55.083
meeting targets, even winning awards,

148
00:08:55.083 --> 00:08:58.666
yet if your journey runs only

149
00:08:58.666 --> 00:09:02.125
on the craving for ‘more,’

150
00:09:02.125 --> 00:09:06.791
then no achievement will ever feel enough.

151
00:09:06.791 --> 00:09:09.791
Prasaktah kama-bhogeshhu.

152
00:09:09.791 --> 00:09:13.833
When work is done only from attachment,

153
00:09:13.833 --> 00:09:16.250
it does not elevate,

154
00:09:16.250 --> 00:09:18.916
but becomes like

155
00:09:18.916 --> 00:09:21.958
a forced grind.

156
00:09:21.958 --> 00:09:24.833
You work not because

157
00:09:24.833 --> 00:09:29.416
you love it, but because

158
00:09:29.416 --> 00:09:32.791
you fear stopping.

159
00:09:32.791 --> 00:09:36.000
Every new position, every new income

160
00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:39.416
gives a moment of excitement.

161
00:09:39.416 --> 00:09:40.958
Then

162
00:09:40.958 --> 00:09:42.416
comes back

163
00:09:42.416 --> 00:09:44.416
the same question.

164
00:09:44.416 --> 00:09:47.875
‘What next?

165
00:09:47.875 --> 00:09:49.666
Who is ahead of me?

166
00:09:49.666 --> 00:09:53.125
Am I falling behind?’

167
00:09:53.125 --> 00:09:57.833
In this state, joy is lost.

168
00:09:57.833 --> 00:10:00.916
Comparison begins.

169
00:10:00.916 --> 00:10:05.083
Under pressure you exhaust yourself,

170
00:10:05.083 --> 00:10:08.083
sometimes compromise, and slowly

171
00:10:08.083 --> 00:10:11.291
purpose gets buried under pressure.

172
00:10:11.291 --> 00:10:13.666
Remember,

173
00:10:13.666 --> 00:10:16.000
aneka-chitta-

174
00:10:16.000 --> 00:10:17.875
vibhrantah,

175
00:10:17.875 --> 00:10:22.916
a scattered mind can never give
lasting fulfilment.

176
00:10:22.916 --> 00:10:28.000
But when ambition is connected to clarity,

177
00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:31.375
and work moves not only by speed,

178
00:10:31.375 --> 00:10:34.333
but by values,

179
00:10:34.333 --> 00:10:37.041
then I walk with you.

180
00:10:37.041 --> 00:10:39.250
You did not come into this world

181
00:10:39.250 --> 00:10:43.166
only to run a meaningless race.

182
00:10:43.166 --> 00:10:45.416
You are here

183
00:10:45.416 --> 00:10:47.666
to give something

184
00:10:47.666 --> 00:10:52.458
that is meaningful, and that lasts.
